  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Evolving Absorbing Replication</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/43/Upgrade_tree.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160930214246\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Upgrade tree\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/43/Upgrade_tree.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20160930214246\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/43/Upgrade_tree.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20160930214246 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/43/Upgrade_tree.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160930214246 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Upgrade tree\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Upgrade_tree.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Upgrade tree.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">All these options...</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Upgrade and evolve absorbed materials.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The ability to <b>absorb and replicate any materials, then upgrade/augment absorbed materials</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Fusionism\" title=\"Evolving Fusionism\">Evolving Fusionism</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvolving_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Evolving Sentient System</li>\n<li>Evolutionary/Evolving Assimilative/Merging Replication/Cloning</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvolving_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can absorb and replicate any materials and then upgrade any materials, abilities, powers, or miscellaneous things that they've absorbed, and replicate them in their evolved form. For example, the user could absorb a steam engine and turn it into a nuclear reactor (steam engine =&gt; upgrade =&gt; nuclear reactor). Like with <a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Power_Replication\" title=\"Evolving Power Replication\">Evolving Power Replication</a>, the user can also \"branch out\" with these materials, changing them into something else marginally related to it or turning it into something less advanced or powerful -- an example would be absorbing an airplane and turning it into a glider (airplane =&gt; downgrade =&gt; glider) or vise versa.\n</p><p>Essentially, this makes the user a living evolving system. Each and every material absorbed can be internally evolved or upgraded into a new ability, or retrogressively downgraded into another thing, and upgraded from there. Upgrades can be done by pure thought alone, or by an RPG-style \"upgrade tree\". Furthermore, users can internally fuse materials absorbed, upgrading them that way, and turning them into a new material entirely, which can then be upgraded or retrograded at the user's whim.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvolving_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptation_Manipulation\" title=\"Adaptation Manipulation\">Adaptation Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Replication\" title=\"Adaptive Replication\">Adaptive Replication</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Construction_Manipulation\" title=\"Construction Manipulation\">Construction Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Construct_Creation\" title=\"Construct Creation\">Construct Creation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnireplication\" title=\"Omnireplication\">Omnireplication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Manipulation\" title=\"Property Manipulation\">Property Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quality_Manipulation\" title=\"Quality Manipulation\">Quality Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Quality_Enhancement\" title=\"Quality Enhancement\">Quality Enhancement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Refining\" title=\"Refining\">Refining</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Properties_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Properties Manipulation\">Supernatural Properties Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Conversion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Total Conversion\">Total Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Matter_Transmutation\" title=\"Meta Matter Transmutation\">Meta Matter Transmutation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Customization_Manipulation\" title=\"Customization Manipulation\">Customization Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolution_Manipulation\" title=\"Evolution Manipulation\">Evolution Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mutation_Manipulation\" title=\"Mutation Manipulation\">Mutation Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Customization\" title=\"Omni-Customization\">Omni-Customization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Augmentation\" title=\"Omni-Augmentation\">Omni-Augmentation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Customization\" title=\"Personal Customization\">Personal Customization</a>: Refashion materials with personalized modifications.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Conglomeration\" title=\"Property Conglomeration\">Property Conglomeration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Remaking\" title=\"Remaking\">Remaking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Evolution\" title=\"Self-Evolution\">Self-Evolution</a>: Expedite the potential utility/evolution of said materials.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Upgrading\" title=\"Upgrading\">Upgrading</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Fusionism\" title=\"Evolving Fusionism\">Evolving Fusionism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Exotic_Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Exotic Matter Manipulation\">Exotic Matter Manipulation</a>: Fabricating new and interesting forms of intriguing Materia</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gestalt_Form\" title=\"Gestalt Form\">Gestalt Form</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Hybrid_Physiology\" title=\"Hybrid Physiology\">Hybrid Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Mixture\" title=\"Power Mixture\">Power Mixture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Manipulation\">Fantastic-Matter Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Foreign_Material_Manipulation\" title=\"Foreign Material Manipulation\">Foreign Material Manipulation</a>: Creating and manipulating fused/upgraded materials.</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Foreign_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Foreign Energy Manipulation\">Foreign Energy Manipulation</a>: Amalgamating and focusing alternative/new energies.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mutative_Regeneration\" title=\"Mutative Regeneration\">Mutative Regeneration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Body_Modification\" title=\"Body Modification\">Body Modification</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolutionary_Immortality\" title=\"Evolutionary Immortality\">Evolutionary Immortality</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhancing_Mutation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhancing Mutation\">Enhancing Mutation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mimetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Mimetic Regeneration\">Mimetic Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Mutation_Manipulation\" title=\"Personal Mutation Manipulation\">Personal Mutation Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reactive_Attribute_Enhancement\" title=\"Reactive Attribute Enhancement\">Reactive Attribute Enhancement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Adaptation\" title=\"Self-Adaptation\">Self-Adaptation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Appearance\" title=\"Adaptive Appearance\">Adaptive Appearance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transformation_Advancement\" title=\"Transformation Advancement\">Transformation Advancement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Conversion\" title=\"Omni-Conversion\">Omni-Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Conversion_Subordination\" title=\"Conversion Subordination\">Conversion Subordination</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Upgrading_Subordination\" title=\"Upgrading Subordination\">Upgrading Subordination</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infusion\" title=\"Infusion\">Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Genetic_Archiving\" title=\"Omni-Genetic Archiving\">Omni-Genetic Archiving</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Resurrective_Rebirth\" title=\"Resurrective Rebirth\">Resurrective Rebirth</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Singularity\" title=\"Singularity\">Singularity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Vortex_Creation\" title=\"Absorbing Vortex Creation\">Absorbing Vortex Creation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Enhanced Power Absorption\">Enhanced Power Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Power_Replication\" title=\"Evolving Power Replication\">Evolving Power Replication</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tactile_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Tactile Power Absorption\">Tactile Power Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvolving_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Bio-Absorbing Replication\">Bio-Absorbing Replication</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvolving_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Almighty_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Almighty Absorbing Replication\">Almighty Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_Growing_Booster\" title=\"Independent Growing Booster\">Independent Growing Booster</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Tier_Activation\" title=\"Ability Tier Activation\">Ability Tier Activation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnifarious\" title=\"Omnifarious\">Omnifarious</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shapeshifting\" title=\"Shapeshifting\">Shapeshifting</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shapeshifting_Combat\" title=\"Shapeshifting Combat\">Shapeshifting Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transmutation\" title=\"Transmutation\">Transmutation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvolving_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be a limit to what and how much the user can absorb.</li>\n<li>User may not be able to change an upgraded material back to what it was.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Mimicry_Immunity\" title=\"Power Mimicry Immunity\">Power Mimicry Immunity</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Anchoring\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Anchoring\">Power Anchoring</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Anti_Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anti Storage\">Anti Storage</a> makes it useless.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvolving_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Space Monsters (<i>Diebuster</i>)</li>\n<li>Chaos (<i>Sora no Otoshimono</i>)</li>\n<li>Protege (<i>Marvel Comics</i>); after copying Deviant Skrulls abilities</li>\n<li>Rimuru Tempest (Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken)</li>\n<li>Upgrade (<i>Ben 10)</i>\n<ul><li>Galvanic Mechamorph (<i>Ben 10)</i></li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260805031808\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 162/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.550      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    9.550      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:240895-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260805031808 and revision id 2644007. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
